decision_flow:
flowchart TD
  A{Decision depends on a model?} -->|No| B[Record decision without model ID]
  A -->|Yes| C{Exact model ID recorded?}
  C -->|No| D[Record the dated or dateless model ID]
  D --> C
  C -->|Yes| E{Review criteria set?}
  E -->|No| F[Write measurable review criteria]
  E -->|Yes| G{Successor can run the system from the record?}
  G -->|No| H[Add absent fields in a new record]
  G -->|Yes| I[Record is complete]
